      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سحّر</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَسْحِيرٌ</span>: see 1, in four places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
Also (tropical:)  <i>He fed</i> another, or others, <i>with the food,</i>
or <i>meal, called the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَحُور</span>: (M, Mgh, TA:) or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَحَّرَهُمْ</span> signifies <i>he gave to them the meal so
called.</i> (Mgh.)

